  "description": "Azure Cosmos DB (NoSQL API) storage provider for YesSql — run Orchard Core (and any YesSql-based store) on Cosmos DB. Supports map/reduce indexes, queries, optimistic concurrency, and atomic unit-of-work rollback (single-partition PerStore mode).",
  "id": "YesSql.Provider.CosmosDb",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-06-04T16:36:33.86Z",
